        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: سرمایه",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سرمایه (sarmâye) — \"capital, an investment\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او با سرمایه کمی یک فروشگاه باز کرد. u bâ sarmâye-ye kami yek forushgâh bâz kard. He opened a shop with a little capital."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sar \"head\" + mâye \"substance, stock\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سرمایه (sarmâye) is a native Persian compound built from sar \"head\" + mâye \"substance, stock\", which EtymDB traces to Middle Persian \"essence, substance\". Capital is the head stock of a business."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling, explaining and describing at B1."
            }
          ]
        },
