          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سرمایه گذاری کردن (sarmâye gozâri kardan) — \"to invest\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "پدرم در یک شرکت کوچک سرمایه گذاری کرد. pedaram dar yek sherkat-e kuchek sarmâye gozâri kard. My father invested in a small company."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sarmâye + gozâri \"placing\", from gozâshtan \"to put\", + kardan. Takes dar."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سرمایه گذاری کردن (sarmâye gozâri kardan) is native Persian, built from sarmâye \"capital\" + gozâri \"placing\", built on gozâr-, the present stem of gozâshtan \"to put\", + kardan. To invest is to place capital."
            }
          ]
        },
