              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "آن شرکت سال گذشته ورشکسته شد. ân sherkat sâl-e gozashte varshekaste shod. That company went bankrupt last year."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Var + shekaste \"broken\". Varshekast shodan — to go bankrupt."
